          "pairing": "Jinx",
          "fuseType": "2X Assist",
          "explanation": "Jinx assist creates amazing cover for Thresh. Thresh's back assist is amazing for punishes, baiting parries (on tag out), and his forward assist disables retreating guard until the last hit. Having 2 of them back to back is very strong.",
