            {
              "id": "F3x1-NNy6h4"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "pairing": "Akali",
          "fuseType": "Freestyle",
          "explanation": "Thresh enables Akali to do all the mix she wants. Akali assists are fairly weak but work surprisingly well for Thresh. Her back assist is a great anti-air when they start jump Thresh 5H/S1 stuff. And her forward assist is fast enough to enable Thresh dash crossups.\n\nPlay Akali point so that she dies first and gives Thresh her amazing super assist which can help with his zoning or pickup combos off held teleport because it OTGs.",
